        "visual_evidence": "Frames 0-9 show the opening view: the Primemall building with its triangular dark roof, diamond-patterned orange facade and 'Primemall' sign. Frames ~10-30 pan right smoothly. The pan passes the orange pyramid-roofed 'Dhrumall' building and reaches a blue-glass building, then settles on a planter with a blue umbrella and round tables. That planter view holds for the long WAIT period (~frames 30-275) with only small drift. Pedestrians move and a sign flickers slightly, but the geometry is stable. From ~frame 276 the camera pans left. It retraces the same sequence in reverse: glass building, then the Dhrumall pyramid with its umbrellas, then the Primemall facade. By ~frames 300-304 the framing closely matches the start: same roof silhouette, 'Primemall' sign, entrance kiosk and small umbrella. The camera then continues slightly further left. In the final second it shows a dark blue building, a tall pole and a white car on the left, with Primemall shifted to the right of frame. This is a modest yaw overshoot, not a scene change. The landmark identity, sign text and layout are preserved.",
